  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT TV SURDO - DISABILITY AND INCLUSION (INFORMATION ABOUT AND FROM PEOPLE WITH DISABILITY) IN MOZAMBIQUE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed grant to TV Surdo is a continuation of last year`s project. The Embassy plans to fund the implementation of the project Increasing Inclusive Information about and from People with Disability (PWD) in Mozambique which seeks to support PWD to reach their full potential by improving health, education, social and economic outcomes through inclusive media and advocacy. The project will take place in 8 provinces Inhambane, Gaza, Sofala, Manica, Nampula, Zamb&#xE9;zia, Cabo Delgado and Maputo.</narrative>
  </description>
